    *   **引用:** "input T1 images are N4-bias corrected... HIPS-THOMAS... The estimated total intracranial volume (eTIV) was generated using the FreeSurfer mri_segstats binary... site effects were mitigated with ComBat... in NeuroHarmonize Python library"
